operations of this folder:

    verified by:
        static (1):
            "ls" producing "active/, archive/, templates/"
        runtime (0):
            "projects load" when "session starts"
        integrity (-1):
            "stale projects" detected by "date check"

    accessed through:
        to access this folder:
            "cd bereshit/tov/data/system/projects/"
            "ls -la" returns "project structure"

policy of this folder:

    modification:
        safe (1):
            "Add new projects"
            "Move between active/archive"
        careful (0):
            "Delete projects"
        never (-1):
            "Delete without archiving"

    future:
        planned (1):
            "Project analytics"
        considered (0):
            "Project dependencies"
        rejected (-1):
            none

synthesis of this folder:

    closing note:
        role "Projects — tracking work across sessions"
        scripture "To every thing there is a season"
            from Ecclesiastes 3:1 in KJV

    quick reference:
        navigate "cd bereshit/tov/data/system/projects/"
        active "ls active/"
        archive "ls archive/"

